382	    /**
383	     * Delete a media item and all its artifacts.
384	     *
385	     * Images are cleaned up synchronously (small number of files).
386	     * Videos are cleaned up asynchronously via DeleteMediaArtifactsJob (many HLS segments).
387	     *
